# Commit text as LF regardless of the checkout platform. Without this, editing
# a CRLF file on a machine configured for LF rewrites every line, which is how
# schema.ts landed as a 1262-line diff for a 42-line change (6a5afcb).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
